// The phone app of Yaseen Docs (code name Notecard; YAZ-5087; decision 8, round 10 item 16, round 12 item 14):
// Cloudflare Workers static assets, published by hand with `npm run mobile:publish:preview` (mobile/README.md, "How to
// publish"). The Worker keeps its first name, `yaseen-notecards-preview`.
// YAZ-5645 (slice 1, decision D3): the static files, plus a small script (`worker/index.ts`) that runs FIRST only for
// `/api/github/*`: the three POST routes of "Sign in with GitHub" (token, refresh, revoke), which add the client secret
// (`GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET`, a Worker secret; `mobile/.dev.vars` on a computer, git-ignored). Every other path is the
// static files, as before. No workers.dev address, no logs, no storage. The token pair passes through in memory only.
// YAZ-5579: ONE address, the real one, docs.yaseenarshad.com (Yaseen: "lets just do everything on the real address").
// The two preview addresses (preview.notecard…, preview.docs…) are detached; links made on them still paste
// (`shared/friendLinks.ts`, SITES). The first route is the one `publish/keepPrevious.ts` reads the live build from.
{
  "name": "yaseen-notecards-preview",
  "account_id": "06ed69083fae875c626d37f9c05405a3",
  "compatibility_date": "2026-11-13",
  "workers_dev": false,
  "preview_urls": false,
  "routes": [
    { "pattern": "docs.yaseenarshad.com", "custom_domain": true }
  ],
  "main": "./worker/index.ts",
  "assets": {
    "directory": "./dist",
    "binding": "ASSETS",
    "run_worker_first": ["/api/github/*"],
    "not_found_handling": "single-page-application",
    "html_handling": "auto-trailing-slash"
  }
}
